sentry-cocoa provides CMake targets:

    find_package(unofficial-sentry-cocoa CONFIG REQUIRED)
    target_link_libraries(main PRIVATE unofficial::sentry-cocoa::sentry)

find_package also sets SENTRY_COCOA_FRAMEWORK_DIR to the SentryObjC.framework
bundle, which has to be embedded in the application, and
SENTRY_COCOA_FRAMEWORK_DSYM_DIR to its separated symbols.
